  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#288] Fix TicTacToe gameplay bugs, improve computer AI, add clustering\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#288] Replace RockPaperScissors matchmaking state with a persisted, cluster-wide store\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#46] Replace ChatChannel's node-local session state with a persisted, cluster-wide store\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#40] Replace runtime-derived OTel instrument/activity names with static ones for Chat pipelines\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#39] Migrate direct ILogger calls to LoggerMessageAttribute source-generated logging\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#38] Bound previously-unbounded Chat input fields, close WS message-blank gap\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#37] Fix unconditional throw after a valid TicTacToe move\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#36] Fix IDOR: derive portfolio Key from the caller's own subscription\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#35] Stop exposing full group membership through Groups/GetAll\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#34] Enable ChatChannelMetadata's transport-level authentication flag\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#33] Fix IDOR: require group membership before fanning out a group message\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#31] Fix IDOR: require group membership before AddUser/RemoveUser/Rename/SetIcon\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#25] Make AirportDemoChannelFeeder's departure comparisons midnight-safe\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#22] Fix swapped DownStreamSize/DownStreamDuration metrics in ThroughputChannelFeeder\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#21] Make PeekRandomPlayer's opponent selection atomic with reservation\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#20] Use Interlocked.Exchange for _lastBytesReceived/_lastBytesSent\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#18] Issue weather API calls concurrently in TimeZonesChannelFeeder\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#17] Make WeatherApiService's semaphore an instance field\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#16] Replace SlidingExpiration with AbsoluteExpirationRelativeToNow in CachedWeatherHandler\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#15] Don't cache failed weather API responses\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#14] Remove GetAwaiter().GetResult() blocking calls in PortfolioDemoChannel subscription hooks\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#12] Fix and re-enable RockPaperScissors gameplay with sessions and push notifications\\n- Fix unresolved XML doc cref in TimeoutAudioFrameSourceTests\\n- [ThunderPropagator.Channels#11] Fix async void Simulate() silently swallowing exceptions",
